Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:21:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] libretro: implement retro_cheat_reset/retro_cheat_set

Back the libretro cheat interface with Azahar's cheat engine so frontends can
toggle Gateway/Action Replay cheats while a game runs.
---
 externals/dynarmic                    |  2 +-
 src/citra_libretro/citra_libretro.cpp | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

